WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 12.5 · Partnerships & Ecosystem Building
Alignment, power dynamics and equitable partnerships

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Name the differences and where power sits, then design for fairness.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Agree what success means for each side.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Check money, information, access, credit and decisions.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Check your own power too, not only theirs.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Riverside: the council holds the contract; Riverside holds volunteers, data and trust. Joint targets and a review where both can propose changes.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You assess alignment and power in one partnership.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
